{
  "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>롯데월드타워 설계 과정 — 개념 재구성</title>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#0e1116;--panel:#171c24;--ink:#e8ecf2;--mute:#9aa6b8;--acc:#e0a44a;--line:#2a3240;--blue:#6fb6ff}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:15px/1.5 \"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",system-ui,sans-serif}\nheader{padding:16px 20px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\nh1{margin:0;font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.02em}\nheader p{margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--mute);font-size:.9rem}\n.badge{display:inline-block;background:#24303f;color:var(--blue);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:.78rem;margin-left:8px}\nmain{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr 1fr;gap:12px;padding:12px 20px 24px}\nsection{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px}\nh2{font-size:1rem;margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--acc);font-weight:600}\n.dw{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}\nfigure{margin:0;background:#0b0e13;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:6px}\nfigure svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}\nfigcaption{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--mute);margin-top:4px}\n.view{position:relative;height:420px;background:#0b0e13;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line)}\n.view canvas{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;outline:none}\n.view canvas:focus{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px var(--blue)}\n.ctl{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:8px 0}\nbutton{background:#232c38;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid #3a4557;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 10px;font-size:.85rem;cursor:pointer}\nbutton:hover{border-color:var(--acc)}\nbutton:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:2px}\nbutton[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:var(--acc);color:#1a1200;border-color:var(--acc);font-weight:600}\nlabel{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--mute)}\ninput[type=range]{width:100%;accent-color:var(--acc)}\n.note{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--mute);margin:6px 0 0}\n.est{color:#f0c48a}\n.desc{font-size:.88rem;min-height:4.5em;margin:0 0 6px}\n.hint{position:absolute;left:8px;bottom:6px;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--mute);pointer-events:none}\n.fail{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:100%;color:var(--mute);padding:20px;text-align:center}\nfooter{padding:0 20px 20px;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--mute)}\nfooter a{color:var(--blue)}\n@media(max-width:1100px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}\n@media(max-width:720px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:10px}.view{height:340px}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header>\n<h1>롯데월드타워 — 설계 과정 인터랙티브 재구성 <span class=\"badge\">claude-fable-5.1</span></h1>\n<p>서울 잠실, 높이 555 m · 지상 123층. 위로 갈수록 좁아지는 형태와 한국 도자기의 선(KPF 설명)을 공개 자료로 재해석한 <strong class=\"est\">설명용 개념 모델</strong>입니다. 공식 시공 도면·검증 구조 설계가 아니며, <span class=\"est\">주황색 표시</span>는 추정 치수입니다.</p>\n</header>\n<main>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"h-dw\">\n<h2 id=\"h-dw\">① 설계도면 (SVG, 단위 m)</h2>\n<div class=\"dw\">\n<figure><svg id=\"svSite\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"배치도\"></svg><figcaption><b>배치도</b> — 대지·타워 발자국·북향. 타워 저층 폭 <span class=\"est\">약 72 m(추정)</span>, 주변 포디움은 개념 표현.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><svg id=\"svPlan\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"기준층 평면도\"></svg><figcaption><b>기준층 평면도</b> — 선택 층의 외곽. 코어 위치·크기는 <span class=\"est\">추정</span>. 치수는 모델 함수값.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><svg id=\"svElev\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"입면도\"></svg><figcaption><b>입면도</b> — 전체 높이 555 m(공개값). 폭 변화 곡선은 <span class=\"est\">개념 추정</span>.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><svg id=\"svSect\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"단면도\"></svg><figcaption><b>단면도</b> — 123층(공개값), 층고 평균 ≈555/123≈4.5 m. 코어·아웃리거 위치는 <span class=\"est\">추정</span>.</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n<label for=\"fl\">기준층 선택: <b id=\"flv\">60</b>층 (높이 <b id=\"flh\">0</b> m) — 도면·3D 모델에 동시에 표시</label>\n<input id=\"fl\" type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"123\" value=\"60\" aria-label=\"층 선택\">\n</section>\n\n<section aria-labelledby=\"h-st\">\n<h2 id=\"h-st\">② 설계 발전 단계</h2>\n<div class=\"ctl\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"설계 단계\">\n<button data-s=\"0\" aria-pressed=\"true\">1 배치·매스</button>\n<button data-s=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"false\">2 테이퍼</button>\n<button data-s=\"2\" aria-pressed=\"false\">3 도자기 곡선</button>\n<button data-s=\"3\" aria-pressed=\"false\">4 외피·정점</button>\n</div>\n<p class=\"desc\" id=\"desc\"></p>\n<div class=\"view\"><canvas id=\"c1\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"선택 단계 3D 모델. 드래그 회전, 휠 확대, 방향키 회전\"></canvas><div class=\"hint\">드래그 회전 · 휠/핀치 확대 · 방향키</div></div>\n<div class=\"ctl\"><button id=\"r1\">시점 초기화</button><span class=\"note\">입면도의 윤곽선이 현재 단계 형상으로 갱신됩니다.</span></div>\n</section>\n\n<section aria-labelledby=\"h-fn\">\n<h2 id=\"h-fn\">③ 완성 모델 (555 m · 123층)</h2>\n<p class=\"desc\">단계 4의 형상에 층 띠·외피 분할선·정점 랜턴을 더한 최종 개념 모델. 노란 띠 = 선택한 기준층 높이.</p>\n<div class=\"view\"><canvas id=\"c2\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"완성 3D 모델. 드래그 회전, 휠 확대, 방향키 회전\"></canvas><div class=\"hint\">드래그 회전 · 휠/핀치 확대 · 방향키</div></div>\n<div class=\"ctl\"><button id=\"r2\">시점 초기화</button><button id=\"spin\" aria-pressed=\"false\">자동 회전</button></div>\n<p class=\"note\">근거: 높이 555 m, 123층, 상부 축소 형태 — 공개 자료. 저층 폭·곡률·코어·랜턴 치수 — <span class=\"est\">추정</span>.</p>\n</section>\n</main>\n<footer>참고(텍스트 출처, 실행 중 접속하지 않음): KPF — kpf.com/project/lotte-world-tower · LERA — lera.com/lotte-world-tower. 생성 모델: claude-fable-5.1 (us.anthropic.claude-fable-5-1)</footer>\n<script src=\"../runtime/three-runtime.js\"></script>\n<script>\n(function(){\nconst H=555,FLOORS=123,BASE=36,TOP=13;\nconst reduce=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\nlet stage=0,floor=60,spin=false;\nconst DESC=[\n '대지 위에 발자국(저층 폭 약 72 m, 추정)을 잡고 555 m 높이의 단순 직육면체 매스를 세워 규모와 배치를 검토하는 단계.',\n '위로 갈수록 기준층 면적을 줄이는 테이퍼 적용. 상부 폭은 약 26 m(추정)로 수렴하며 구조 효율과 조망을 함께 고려한 개념.',\n '직선 테이퍼를 한국 도자기의 완만한 곡선으로 바꾸고, 모서리를 둥글려 네모난 저층이 상부에서 부드러운 타원형에 가까워지도록 변화.',\n '유리 외피의 수직 분할선과 정상부의 열린 랜턴(추정)을 더해 외관을 정리. 완성 모델(③)의 기초 형상.'\n];\nfunction hw(t,s){ if(s===0)return BASE; if(s===1)return BASE+(TOP-BASE)*t; return TOP+(BASE-TOP)*Math.pow(1-t,1.35); }\nfunction nExp(t,s){ return s<2?12:(6-3.6*t); }\nfunction ring(t,s,n){const a=[],r=hw(t,s),e=nExp(t,s);for(let i=0;i<n;i++){const th=i/n*Math.PI*2,c=Math.cos(th),si=Math.sin(th);a.push([r*Math.sign(c)*Math.pow(Math.abs(c),2/e),r*Math.sign(si)*Math.pow(Math.abs(si),2/e)]);}return a;}\n\n/* ---------- SVG drawings ---------- */\nconst S=(id)=>document.getElementById(id);\nfunction el(n,at){const e=document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg',n);for(const k in at)e.setAttribute(k,at[k]);return e;}\nfunction txt(p,x,y,s,o){const t=el('text',Object.assign({x,y,fill:'#c6d0de','font-size':7,'font-family':'sans-serif'},o||{}));t.textContent=s;p.appendChild(t);return t;}\nfunction clear(p){while(p.firstChild)p.removeChild(p.firstChild);}\nfunction drawSite(){const p=S('svSite');clear(p);\n p.appendChild(el('rect',{x:20,y:20,width:180,height:180,fill:'#121a22',stroke:'#4a5a70','stroke-dasharray':'4 2'}));\n p.appendChild(el('rect',{x:30,y:110,width:160,height:80,fill:'#1b2531',stroke:'#3a4a60'}));\n const rg=ring(0,stage,64),cx=110,cy=96,k=1.2;\n p.appendChild(el('polygon',{points:rg.map(q=>(cx+q[0]*k)+','+(cy-q[1]*k)).join(' '),fill:'#2b4a6e',stroke:'#e0a44a','stroke-width':1.2}));\n txt(p,70,100,'타워 발자국 '+(2*BASE)+' m*',{fill:'#f0c48a'});txt(p,36,152,'저층부 포디움 (개념)');txt(p,22,15,'대지 경계 (개념)');\n txt(p,172,36,'N',{fill:'#fff','font-size':9});p.appendChild(el('path',{d:'M176 60 L176 42 M172 46 L176 42 L180 46',stroke:'#fff',fill:'none'}));\n p.appendChild(el('path',{d:'M30 208 L90 208',stroke:'#c6d0de','stroke-width':2}));txt(p,30,217,'0');txt(p,84,217,'50 m');txt(p,120,217,'*추정',{fill:'#f0c48a'});\n}\nfunction drawPlan(){const p=S('svPlan');clear(p);const t=(floor-1)/(FLOORS-1),rg=ring(t,stage,96),w=hw(t,stage),cx=110,cy=105,k=2.2;\n p.appendChild(el('polygon',{points:ring(0,stage,96).map(q=>(cx+q[0]*k)+','+(cy-q[1]*k)).join(' '),fill:'none',stroke:'#3a4a60','stroke-dasharray':'3 2'}));\n p.appendChild(el('polygon',{points:rg.map(q=>(cx+q[0]*k)+','+(cy-q[1]*k)).join(' '),fill:'#1f3550',stroke:'#e0a44a','stroke-width':1.3}));\n const c=Math.max(5,w*0.42)*k;p.appendChild(el('rect',{x:cx-c/2,y:cy-c/2,width:c,height:c,fill:'#3c2f1a',stroke:'#f0c48a'}));\n txt(p,cx-10,cy+3,'코어*',{fill:'#f0c48a','font-size':6.5});\n const y=cy+w*k+10;p.appendChild(el('path',{d:'M'+(cx-w*k)+' '+y+' L'+(cx+w*k)+' '+y,stroke:'#c6d0de'}));\n txt(p,cx-18,y+9,(2*w).toFixed(1)+' m*',{fill:'#f0c48a'});\n txt(p,8,12,floor+'층 평면 (바닥 '+Math.round((floor-1)*H/FLOORS)+' m)');txt(p,8,212,'점선=1층 외곽 · *추정');\n}\nfunction elevPath(s){const pts=[];for(let i=0;i<=60;i++){const t=i/60;pts.push([hw(t,s),t]);}return pts;}\nfunction drawElevLike(p,isSect){clear(p);const cx=110,yb=270,k=0.42,pts=elevPath(stage);\n const L=pts.map(q=>(cx-q[0]*k*1.0)+','+(yb-q[1]*H*k)),R=pts.slice().reverse().map(q=>(cx+q[0]*k)+','+(yb-q[1]*H*k));\n p.appendChild(el('path',{d:'M20 '+yb+' L200 '+yb,stroke:'#6a7a90'}));\n p.appendChild(el('polygon',{points:L.concat(R).join(' '),fill:isSect?'#141c26':'#1f3550',stroke:'#dfe6f0','stroke-width':1}));\n if(isSect){for(let f=0;f<=FLOORS;f+=3){const t=f/FLOORS,w=hw(t,stage)*k;p.appendChild(el('path',{d:'M'+(cx-w)+' '+(yb-t*H*k)+' L'+(cx+w)+' '+(yb-t*H*k),stroke:'#2e3c50','stroke-width':.5}));}\n  const cw=hw(0,stage)*0.42*k;p.appendChild(el('rect',{x:cx-cw/2,y:yb-H*k*0.97,width:cw,height:H*k*0.97,fill:'#3c2f1a',stroke:'#f0c48a','stroke-width':.6}));\n  [0.3,0.6].forEach(t=>{const w=hw(t,stage)*k;p.appendChild(el('path',{d:'M'+(cx-w)+' '+(yb-t*H*k)+' L'+(cx+w)+' '+(yb-t*H*k),stroke:'#f0c48a','stroke-width':1.5}));});\n  txt(p,cx+hw(0.3,stage)*k+3,yb-0.3*H*k,'아웃리거*',{fill:'#f0c48a','font-size':6});txt(p,cx-8,yb-30,'코어*',{fill:'#f0c48a','font-size':6});\n }else if(stage>=3){for(let i=-3;i<=3;i++){if(!i)continue;const d=pts.map(q=>(cx+q[0]*k*i/3.6)+','+(yb-q[1]*H*k));p.appendChild(el('polyline',{points:d.join(' '),fill:'none',stroke:'#3d5a80','stroke-width':.5}));}}\n const ty=yb-(floor-1)/FLOORS*H*k;p.appendChild(el('path',{d:'M30 '+ty+' L190 '+ty,stroke:'#ffd34d','stroke-width':1,'stroke-dasharray':'3 2'}));\n txt(p,150,ty-2,floor+'F',{fill:'#ffd34d'});\n p.appendChild(el('path',{d:'M206 '+yb+' L206 '+(yb-H*k),stroke:'#c6d0de'}));txt(p,196,yb-H*k-4,'555 m',{fill:'#fff'});txt(p,198,yb+9,'0 m');\n txt(p,8,12,isSect?'종단면 (개념)':'입면 — 단계 '+(stage+1));txt(p,8,290,isSect?'*추정 부재 · 층선 3층마다':'폭 저층 '+(2*hw(0,stage)).toFixed(0)+' m* / 상부 '+(2*hw(1,stage)).toFixed(0)+' m*',{fill:'#f0c48a'});\n}\nfunction drawAll(){drawSite();drawPlan();drawElevLike(S('svElev'),false);drawElevLike(S('svSect'),true);\n S('flv').textContent=floor;S('flh').textContent=Math.round((floor-1)*H/FLOORS);}\n\n/* ---------- 3D ---------- */\nconst ok=typeof THREE!=='undefined'&&THREE.OrbitControls;\nfunction towerGeom(s,rings,segs){const pos=[],idx=[];for(let j=0;j<=rings;j++){const t=j/rings,r=ring(t,s,segs);for(let i=0;i<segs;i++)pos.push(r[i][0],t*H,r[i][1]);}\n for(let j=0;j<rings;j++)for(let i=0;i<segs;i++){const a=j*segs+i,b=j*segs+(i+1)%segs,c=a+segs,d=b+segs;idx.push(a,c,b,b,c,d);}\n const top=pos.length/3;pos.push(0,H,0);for(let i=0;i<segs;i++)idx.push(rings*segs+i,top,rings*segs+(i+1)%segs);\n const g=new THREE.BufferGeometry();g.setAttribute('position',new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(pos,3));g.setIndex(idx);g.computeVertexNormals();return g;}\nfunction makeViewer(cv,withDetail){\n const r=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({canvas:cv,antialias:true});r.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));\n const sc=new THREE.Scene();sc.background=new THREE.Color(0x0b0e13);sc.fog=new THREE.Fog(0x0b0e13,900,2200);\n const cam=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,1,1,5000);const home=new THREE.Vector3(620,420,720);cam.position.copy(home);\n const ct=new THREE.OrbitControls(cam,cv);ct.target.set(0,260,0);ct.enableDamping=!reduce;ct.maxDistance=2500;ct.minDistance=80;ct.listenToKeyEvents&&ct.listenToKeyEvents(cv);\n sc.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xcfe3ff,0x2a2418,0.9));const sun=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xfff0d8,1.1);sun.position.set(400,700,300);sc.add(sun);\n const g=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(1400,1400),new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0x1a222c,roughness:1}));g.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;sc.add(g);\n const grid=new THREE.GridHelper(1400,28,0x334455,0x222c38);grid.position.y=0.2;sc.add(grid);\n const pod=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(150,30,80),new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0x2a3340}));pod.position.set(0,15,95);sc.add(pod);\n const grp=new THREE.Group();sc.add(grp);\n const hl=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(1,1,1.6,64,1,true),new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({color:0xffd34d,side:THREE.DoubleSide}));sc.add(hl);\n function build(s){while(grp.children.length)grp.remove(grp.children[0]);\n  const mat=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:s>=3?0x6f9fcf:0xb9c6d4,metalness:s>=3?0.6:0.1,roughness:s>=3?0.25:0.7,transparent:s>=3,opacity:s>=3?0.92:1});\n  const m=new THREE.Mesh(towerGeom(s,s<2?2:60,s<2?64:96),mat);grp.add(m);\n  if(s>=3||withDetail){const pts=[];const segs=96;\n   for(let f=0;f<=FLOORS;f+=withDetail?4:10){const t=f/FLOORS,rg=ring(t,3,segs);for(let i=0;i<segs;i++){const a=rg[i],b=rg[(i+1)%segs];pts.push(a[0],t*H+0.3,a[1],b[0],t*H+0.3,b[1]);}}\n   for(let i=0;i<segs;i+=8){for(let j=0;j<60;j++){const a=ring(j/60,3,segs)[i],b=ring((j+1)/60,3,segs)[i];pts.push(a[0]*1.003,j/60*H,a[1]*1.003,b[0]*1.003,(j+1)/60*H,b[1]*1.003);}}\n   const lg=new THREE.BufferGeometry();lg.setAttribute('position',new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(pts,3));\n   grp.add(new THREE.LineSegments(lg,new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({color:0xdfeeff,transparent:true,opacity:0.35})));\n   const lan=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(TOP*0.55,TOP*0.95,26,48,1,true),new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0xffe6b0,emissive:0x604010,side:THREE.DoubleSide,t